<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Sys%20traps%20h" title="Sys traps h">sys_traps_h</a>.<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Trap%20ApplyEffect" title="Trap ApplyEffect (page does not exist)">_Trap_ApplyEffect</a> function is used to map the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TRAP%20EFFECT" title="TRAP EFFECT *">TRAP_EFFECT_*</a> values onto the appropriate effect type and creates the actual effect. However this is not a direct translation so, for example <code>TRAP_EFFECT_PARALYSE</code> has a literal value of 10 but is mapped onto <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/EFFECT%20TYPE" title="EFFECT TYPE *">EFFECT_TYPE_PARALYSE</a> which as a literal value of 8. Adding new trap effects would require the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Trap%20ApplyEffect" title="Trap ApplyEffect (page does not exist)">_Trap_ApplyEffect</a> function to be updated and all dependant scripts would have to be recompiled.
</p>
